---
import { orderStages } from './models.mjs';
---
<figure data-a00-order aria-labelledby="a00-order-title">
  <figcaption><span class="eyebrow">Figure 2 · illustrative change</span><strong id="a00-order-title">Which facts survive a failed request?</strong></figcaption>
  <div class="controls"><label>Save the changes <select data-together><option value="separate">Each statement commits</option><option value="together">One transaction</option></select></label><label>Request <select data-fail><option value="fail">Fails after inserting the item</option><option value="success">Completes</option></select></label></div>
  <ol class="steps" data-live>{orderStages(false, true).map((title, i) => <li data-stage={i} aria-current={i === 0 ? 'step' : 'false'}>{title}</li>)}</ol>
  <div class="states" data-live><div><p class="input-title">This request’s view</p><dl><dt>Order 103</dt><dd data-work-order>absent</dd><dt>MUG item for 103</dt><dd data-work-item>absent</dd><dt>Mugs available</dt><dd data-work-stock>1</dd></dl></div><div><p class="input-title">Another session’s view</p><dl><dt>Order 103</dt><dd data-read-order>absent</dd><dt>MUG item for 103</dt><dd data-read-item>absent</dd><dt>Mugs available</dt><dd data-read-stock>1</dd></dl></div></div>
  <p class="flag" data-flag data-live hidden>Mismatch: 1 mug available · its item exists · nothing reserved</p>
  <p class="explanation" data-explanation data-live aria-live="polite">One mug is available. The new order, 103, does not exist.</p>
  <div class="controls"><button type="button" data-play>Play</button><button type="button" data-back aria-disabled="true">Back</button><button type="button" data-next>Next</button><button type="button" data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step>1 / 5</span><span class="hold" data-hold aria-hidden="true"><span></span></span></div>
  <p class="boundary">Model of commit and rollback with one buyer. The other session reads afresh at each step. Accent outlines mark values that changed at that step; red outlines mark facts that disagree. No payment call, elapsed time or competing buyer is simulated; Figure 3 adds the second buyer.</p>
  <details><summary>Read this figure as text</summary><p>With separate commits, a failure after the second statement leaves order 103 and its item but stock unchanged at 1, so the mug is both available and promised. In one transaction, the request sees its own unfinished changes while other sessions do not. Rolling back removes both new rows. On success, COMMIT makes the order, item and stock reduction from 1 to 0 visible together.</p></details>
</figure>
<script>
  import { orderState, orderStages } from './models.mjs';
  import { stepper } from './player.mjs';
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-a00-order]').forEach(root => {
    const get = <T extends HTMLElement>(selector: string) => root.querySelector<T>(selector)!;
    const draw = (step: number) => {
      const together = get<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-together]').value === 'together';
      const fail = get<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-fail]').value === 'fail';
      const state = orderState(step, together, fail);
      for (const [prefix, view, changed] of [['work', state.working, state.changed.working], ['read', state.visible, state.changed.visible]] as const) {
        const values = { order: view.order ? 'pending_payment' : 'absent', item: view.item ? '1 × MUG' : 'absent', stock: String(view.stock) };
        for (const key of ['order', 'item', 'stock'] as const) {
          const el = get(`[data-${prefix}-${key}]`);
          el.textContent = values[key];
          el.classList.toggle('present', key === 'stock' ? false : Boolean(view[key]));
          el.classList.toggle('changed', (changed as readonly string[]).includes(key));
          el.classList.toggle('problem', state.inconsistent && key === 'stock');
        }
      }
      const stages = orderStages(together, fail);
      root.querySelectorAll('[data-stage]').forEach((el, i) => { el.textContent = stages[i]; el.setAttribute('aria-current', i === step ? 'step' : 'false'); });
      get('[data-flag]').hidden = !state.inconsistent;
      get('[data-explanation]').textContent = state.message;
    };
    const player = stepper(root, { steps: () => 5, draw });
    get('[data-together]').addEventListener('change', player.render);
    get('[data-fail]').addEventListener('change', player.render);
  });
</script>
<style>
  figure{--a00-warn:color-mix(in srgb,var(--coral) 75%,var(--color-text));margin:2rem 0;border:1px solid var(--color-rule);padding:1.2rem;background:var(--color-surface-alt)} figcaption strong,figcaption span{display:block} figcaption strong{font-size:1.1rem}
  .controls{display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:1rem 0}label{min-width:0;max-width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;font-size:.8rem;flex-wrap:wrap} button,select{font:inherit;color:var(--color-text);background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-rule);border-radius:.3rem;padding:.45rem .7rem;cursor:pointer}button[aria-disabled="true"]{opacity:.45;cursor:default}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:2px}
  .steps{display:flex;gap:.4rem;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:1.2rem 0}.steps li{flex:1;border-top:3px solid var(--color-rule);padding:.5rem;font-size:.75rem}.steps [aria-current="step"]{border-color:var(--color-accent);font-weight:700}
  .states{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem}.states>div{background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-rule);padding:1rem}.input-title{font-size:.9rem;margin:0 0 .8rem}dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.5rem;font-size:.8rem;margin:0;align-items:center}dt,dd{margin:0;padding:.3rem .4rem}dd{font-family:var(--font-mono);border:2px solid transparent;border-radius:.25rem;text-align:right}
  .present{font-weight:700}.changed{border-color:var(--color-accent);color:var(--color-accent-strong);font-weight:700}.problem{border-color:var(--coral);color:var(--a00-warn)}
  .flag{margin:1rem 0 0;padding:.5rem .7rem;border-inline-start:3px solid var(--coral);background:var(--color-surface);font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600}.flag[hidden]{display:none}
  .explanation{min-height:4rem;font-size:.9rem}.boundary,details{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}summary{cursor:pointer}
  .hold{flex:0 0 4rem;height:3px;background:var(--color-rule)}.hold span{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:var(--color-accent)}
  @media(max-width:600px){figure{padding:.8rem}.states{grid-template-columns:1fr}.steps{gap:.2rem}.steps li{padding:.3rem;font-size:.65rem}select{max-width:100%}}
</style>
